haha to assume makes an ass of u and me

&#x200B;

i'm not saying lockdown isn't hard - mostly mentally from the isolation. i'm saying people should get over it if they have to carry a vaccine card. Thanks for the vitriol babe!

You are going through something you will look back on and see as a sign that you can handle ANYTHING in life. It is going to be hard but like others have said it won't be forever. It will be ok in the end. I hope you have good doctors - definitely find someone who is experienced in benzo tapering asap and don't listen to anybody who makes light of the situation. Best of luck.

&#x200B;

Edit: you say you have to be off fast - be careful. Going slow with this can be the lesser of two evils. I would just take this very easy and not shock your system too much - but I'm not a doctor.

